    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d434">

                <pb facs="0750" n="630" xml:id="pg630"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51W89 Italy/191a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Italy (Garrett)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 652</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-06-14">June 14, 1932</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Secretary of State refers to previous correspondence regarding the
                    President’s Proposal of June 20, 1931, for postponement of intergovernmental
                    debts and transmits for the information of the American Ambassador copy of the
                    “Agreement between the Kingdom of Italy and the United States of America, June
                    3, 1932”.<anchor n="60" xml:id="d434-f1"/>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
